<title>USA: El Salvador seeks 8,000-10,000 T US soymeal--agent.</title>
<headline>El Salvador seeks 8,000-10,000 T US soymeal--agent.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>El Salvador is tendering on April 28 for 8,000 to 10,000 tonnes of U.S. soybean meal under the PL-480 credit program, the buyer's agent said.</p>
<p>The meal was slated for May 7-22 shipment.</p>
<p>A previous tender on April 14 for the same quantity of meal, along with vegetable oil and tallow, was cancelled.</p>
<p>&quot;They (El Salvador) will not be seeking vegetable oil and tallow at this tender,&quot; the agent said.</p>
<p>((Nigel Hunt 312-408 8720))</p>
</text>
